{"id":"04dd39f9-8a6f-4ff7-bdf0-23a4a286ad67","expr":"object.getClass() != null","rationale":"Every non-null object in Java has a non-null class object returned by getClass().","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.FieldUtils#findField(Object,String):Field","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/FieldUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:48.493311095Z"}
{"id":"55040ed7-fb62-4c95-9cf4-0f25f4564aa7","expr":"fieldName.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, fieldName should not be empty to identify a field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.FieldUtils#findField(Object,String):Field","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/FieldUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:48.493311095Z"}
{"id":"1f46338e-7042-4be5-9ecb-3cc21c4e43b8","expr":"fieldName != null && !fieldName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method getFieldValue likely expects a non-empty fieldName to find the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.FieldUtils#getFieldValue(Object,String):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/FieldUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:48.493928967Z"}
