{"id":"c3e972b9-77a0-45e3-8576-8170ee0ab864","expr":"declaredClass.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Modifiers of declaredClass are always a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.FieldUtils#findField(Class<?>,String):Field","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/FieldUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:48.490633777Z"}
