{"id":"aea4b7a6-2ea7-4b5b-8595-528967a530ee","expr":"fileName.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"A file name that exists should not be all whitespace, so trimming it leaves some characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ConfigUtils#checkFileNameExist(String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ConfigUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.577760004Z"}
{"id":"d85b14c3-e477-4f79-a8f4-5aa32b3ad43b","expr":"fileName != null && fileName.length() <= 255","rationale":"The length constraint is typical for file names across many operating systems.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ConfigUtils#checkFileNameExist(String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ConfigUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.577760004Z"}
