{"id":"146fb34e-d83e-4702-b786-38f136277f70","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The parameter 'method' should be non-null to call getAnnotation on it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#isDeprecated(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.586761244Z"}
{"id":"fe9c8206-1c38-451f-8bbc-e6a0cd41fdca","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length == 0 || !result","rationale":"Getter methods have zero parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#isGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.587032965Z"}
{"id":"8da889ec-3d0e-48ea-8d3a-ced3ee9bfe0e","expr":"declaredClass != null","rationale":"The method uses declaredClass as a key comparison element, so it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588157521Z"}
{"id":"be9e8086-c5ae-4dd3-8738-471d21298552","expr":"declaredClass.getDeclaringClass() == null","rationale":"This invariant reflects that the declaredClass is a top-level class rather than a nested class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588157521Z"}
{"id":"03686caf-1bb1-4df0-bfaf-21242faae943","expr":"declaredClass.isAnnotation() == false","rationale":"Predicates on declaredClass in method matching usually ignore annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588157521Z"}
{"id":"ba2c18ca-a788-4876-8bd1-a73b796b604a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"At method exit, result is always a non-null Predicate instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588254704Z"}
{"id":"58ca0135-4313-4d60-a5c8-d8a592d4b38b","expr":"declaredClass != null || result.test(null) == false","rationale":"The predicate result should return false when tested with a null Method if declaredClass is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588254704Z"}
{"id":"b1623968-4528-47d6-9e10-a19c4fb15823","expr":"!result.test(null)","rationale":"The predicate tests for inequality of declaredClass and method.getDeclaringClass(), so for null method it returns false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588254704Z"}
{"id":"8bcd1272-3705-4461-88c5-503d7e56dd51","expr":"declaredClass.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Usually predicates for method declarations exclude interfaces in this context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.588157521Z"}
{"id":"603f059f-f5a0-4f6c-9c12-7d1d279183bb","expr":"declaringClass != null && !declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The precondition for the method to proceed is that declaringClass is non-null and not primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593305089Z"}
{"id":"5a9b15c3-98f3-4d77-9295-2de52aeeec27","expr":"publicOnly == true || publicOnly == false","rationale":"publicOnly is a boolean parameter and hence always true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593305089Z"}
{"id":"99791393-03e7-46ab-a4df-38547894432c","expr":"includeInheritedTypes == true || includeInheritedTypes == false","rationale":"includeInheritedTypes is a boolean parameter and hence always true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593305089Z"}
{"id":"110fe0cc-6e07-44e7-b0bb-6d390d0ed7b3","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"methodsToFilter varargs array is expected to be non-null when the method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593305089Z"}
{"id":"7be4ebd4-3067-4660-ad0f-83c0198a16b3","expr":"declaringClass != null && declaringClass.isInterface() == false","rationale":"This predicate method call checks if the declaringClass is a concrete class, which is typical when retrieving declared methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593696405Z"}
