{"id":"82ad1ef6-fb32-4cbf-bc2a-964c44c85462","expr":"methodsToFilter != null && !methodsToFilter.test(null)","rationale":"Ensures the predicate does not accept null, which aligns with usage of filtering actual Method instances.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593696405Z"}
