{"id":"ae036d24-682b-4dc5-a511-97726aeef010","expr":"declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"Ensures that the method array returned by reflection is never null, per standard reflection API contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.593696405Z"}
{"id":"d874047b-69c1-4f4f-b0d2-5f67856cd9b8","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a list of methods, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.596506764Z"}
{"id":"9ec7baa9-d812-4897-a89b-8302306ac892","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The declaringClass parameter must be non-null for this method to work.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.597655505Z"}
{"id":"7e12b24f-b6c0-420e-a3b0-8e67cb2dede2","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"The methodsToFilter predicate parameter is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.597655505Z"}
{"id":"60f72638-23f9-4120-a51a-4d7e811b00ab","expr":"!declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"declaringClass should not be a primitive because primitives do not have methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.597655505Z"}
{"id":"7aaac10b-4d78-4201-b6b2-4f464083f59c","expr":"!declaringClass.isArray()","rationale":"declaringClass should not be an array type because arrays do not have declared methods in the same way.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.597655505Z"}
