{"id":"8ca67b7d-d104-47f7-825b-57ff0af4a2fc","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length == 0","rationale":"If declaringClass has no declared methods, result can be empty; otherwise not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.598210700Z"}
{"id":"611e5fd1-fc67-48a1-9756-66d0ffcc702d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null List even if declaringClass is null or primitive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.598261596Z"}
{"id":"8a38db06-9674-43de-98c6-718e52c0c439","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || declaringClass == null || declaringClass.isPrimitive() || (includeInheritedTypes && result.size() >= declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length)","rationale":"If result is empty, either declaringClass is null/primitive or no matching methods, but if includeInheritedTypes is true, there may be at least as many methods as declared in declaringClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.598261596Z"}
