{"id":"74c0a9a8-fa32-4ca7-91f6-d886777ded68","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is expected to return a List of methods, so result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.603396339Z"}
{"id":"705de373-5656-47a2-af31-547e1576b481","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length == 0","rationale":"If the class declares no methods, result can be empty; otherwise it must contain some methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.603396339Z"}
{"id":"5a621768-2a3d-4f79-8850-bca59fbfc439","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The method getAllMethods requires declaringClass to retrieve methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.603591607Z"}
{"id":"c83af985-34e8-4fec-b6e2-5049e7260730","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"The varargs methodsToFilter parameter should be a valid Predicate array, possibly empty but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.603591607Z"}
{"id":"9da15b42-da4f-428b-a8b1-2ab9f3ccd857","expr":"!declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Primitive types do not have methods, so declaringClass is usually non-primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.603591607Z"}
{"id":"dfb9d068-3e2e-40c8-b071-fb6d858a9ca1","expr":"methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"methodsToFilter length is non-negative as valid array length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.603591607Z"}
{"id":"0d6f9e25-9a78-42c9-97aa-075333a55849","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a List of methods, so the result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.606578167Z"}
