{"id":"1e004008-e5b7-4ddf-9292-b18c340421d2","expr":"m != null && m.getParameterTypes() != null && m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The parameter types array obtained from method m is never null and has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.818277724Z"}
{"id":"8d735908-8c3c-4dd2-99b9-f379a91eed81","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the parameter types array is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.818277724Z"}
{"id":"459b0d26-d9d9-47ec-b6a6-b6683760a1cd","expr":"m != null","rationale":"The input method parameter m is non-null at the method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.818277724Z"}
{"id":"ac41e598-878d-449d-a236-152efd4e3953","expr":"c.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The getParameterTypes method on Constructor should return a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.827269185Z"}
{"id":"17ead34b-f1b6-4b28-8450-2c876ec2e7ea","expr":"c.getParameterCount() == c.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"The parameter count equals the length of the parameter types array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.827269185Z"}
{"id":"25d12594-13d8-48a3-9051-591701b248b7","expr":"c.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"The declaring class of the constructor exists.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.827269185Z"}
{"id":"2efa6f5f-4b87-44f5-b881-21273d6d8eea","expr":"c.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Constructor modifiers are a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.827269185Z"}
{"id":"0411495e-43c8-4de1-bbc1-8cc420593235","expr":"c.getParameterTypes().getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The class of parameterTypes is an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.827269185Z"}
{"id":"85d33a0b-687d-431b-9ab4-456724f7a801","expr":"m != null && m.getParameterTypes() != null && m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method m and its essential method calls must be non-null for the method to execute correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.832440506Z"}
{"id":"7e9927fe-8a74-4c09-a5e1-99ada3cff4bf","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative; relevant for the for-loop iterations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.832440506Z"}
{"id":"066640c2-ee9c-4aec-8182-3ae157816327","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The method appends '(' at the start of the StringBuilder; thus, the returned string must start with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.836468777Z"}
{"id":"79e1a8c3-a58c-46f4-b448-93de4158f8a5","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The result string ends with ')' before the return type descriptor is appended, so overall it must end with ')' at the point of return.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.836468777Z"}
{"id":"4fee8a50-83ca-4084-b422-7ed0147dae79","expr":"result.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The descriptor String always contains a closing parenthesis for the parameter types list, so ')' is contained in the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.836468777Z"}
{"id":"b6f6c4a4-4273-4648-ae38-0fb8c42d57ac","expr":"result.length() >= 3","rationale":"The method creates a descriptor that at minimum is '()' plus the return type descriptor, so length is >= 3.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.836468777Z"}
{"id":"9e5f752a-35dc-4b94-8737-45613af4a6f7","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The CtClass parameter c is expected to be non-null when the method is invoked.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtClass):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.851368938Z"}
{"id":"e16c7dbb-40f7-4d36-935b-f958d5bbe80e","expr":"!c.isArray() || c.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If the CtClass represents an array, its component type should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtClass):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.851368938Z"}
{"id":"47b74a9f-f683-4121-a5a0-7de9f0bb5af1","expr":"!(c.isArray() && c.isPrimitive())","rationale":"CtClass cannot represent a type that is both primitive and an array at the same time.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtClass):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.851368938Z"}
{"id":"30b572af-732f-413a-b69f-69ff1e647df0","expr":"c.getName() != null","rationale":"The name of the CtClass is expected to be non-null for all types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtClass):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.851368938Z"}
{"id":"b264e54b-c66f-4ba9-afb4-b939d603da8e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned descriptor string is constructed and returned by the method, so it cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtClass):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.851730739Z"}
{"id":"0cd847f6-c654-4729-b062-0287d0ae3eaf","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"Descriptors for primitive types are single characters, but for objects and arrays, the length is at least 2 including '[' or 'L...'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtClass):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.851730739Z"}
{"id":"52c31c89-f3bb-4d54-927b-1220bd590bab","expr":"result.length == m.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"The method returns an array of descriptors corresponding to the number of parameters of the input Method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852338833Z"}
{"id":"6fa6406c-28fd-4abe-8917-d75ff93097f7","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the result array is non-negative as it is an array length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852338833Z"}
{"id":"31a564d5-9f02-4d2e-8811-b83a1efa8a97","expr":"m != null && m.getName() != null && !m.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The method getDesc constructs a string starting with m.getName(), implying m and m.getName() should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852871756Z"}
{"id":"43045a7b-77c9-4c13-936f-a1962c19c4a1","expr":"m.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The code iterates over m.getParameterTypes(), so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852871756Z"}
{"id":"495d9754-abb1-4c35-b56e-327662365629","expr":"m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The method calls getDesc(m.getReturnType()), so m.getReturnType() should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852871756Z"}
{"id":"53ce856b-d95b-460d-ab66-1543855143bf","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative, parameterTypes array length is used in iteration.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852871756Z"}
{"id":"4a37f2e5-54d5-489c-a1bc-c860bdbbd50d","expr":"!m.getName().contains(\"(\") && !m.getName().contains(\")\")","rationale":"Method name should not contain parentheses since they are appended separately in the descriptor construction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.852871756Z"}
{"id":"5fe2390e-7808-412a-9706-aae0bafbd361","expr":"result.startsWith(m.getName() + \"(\")","rationale":"The result string should start with the method name and '(' because the method builds the descriptor starting with the method name and '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.863119451Z"}
{"id":"a251cfd4-1699-4ed8-be2f-c9bcc57d3b87","expr":"result.contains(\"(\") && result.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The result string always contains '(' and ')' because it encloses the parameter descriptors in parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.863119451Z"}
{"id":"9694544e-7c01-42af-a1b8-fcfed8bca731","expr":"result.indexOf('(') < result.indexOf(')')","rationale":"The '(' character occurs before the ')' character in the descriptor because it surrounds the parameter types list.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.863119451Z"}
{"id":"0ce18059-744d-4787-8036-ea4611c64b69","expr":"result.length() >= m.getName().length() + 2","rationale":"The result length is at least the length of the method name plus two characters for the parentheses, accounting for possible empty parameter list.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.863119451Z"}
{"id":"9af789c6-798b-4c6d-bf34-6780677470e4","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The returned string must begin with an opening parenthesis since the method initializes with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.863946007Z"}
{"id":"adcd128c-9be4-4d6c-b943-149d377bad20","expr":"result.length() >= 3","rationale":"Even if there are no parameters, the returned string is \"()V\", length 3 or more for parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.863946007Z"}
{"id":"fe5b6b25-f422-4691-8a2c-51c24e83535b","expr":"c != null && c.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The constructor's parameter types array is expected to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.868618890Z"}
{"id":"ed3ffc99-007b-485b-85fa-34539bc2d5e0","expr":"c.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The length of parameter types array is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.868618890Z"}
{"id":"20879b0d-6652-467c-b897-a55c9961e35d","expr":"c.getParameterTypes().length == 0 || c.getParameterTypes()[0] != null","rationale":"If there are parameter types, at least the first parameter type is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.868618890Z"}
{"id":"b10686c6-a820-4e8d-9be3-9c82dc1d0d28","expr":"c.getParameterTypes().length == 0 || c.getParameterTypes()[0].getName() != null","rationale":"If the constructor has parameter types, the first parameter type's name is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.868618890Z"}
{"id":"8394c74f-4c7b-40ea-b84e-44d114f41dec","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The method builds the descriptor string starting with an opening parenthesis.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.873616565Z"}
{"id":"11fcf66b-9fda-4103-bdda-d73de6141f3c","expr":"result.length() >= 3","rationale":"The shortest possible descriptor string is \"()V\" which is of length 3.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.873616565Z"}
{"id":"0daccb13-230d-40e9-a4bc-395403ceafd2","expr":"result.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The method appends a closing parenthesis after listing parameter descriptors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(CtConstructor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.873616565Z"}
{"id":"071bf616-eba2-471c-926a-832c451fab59","expr":"m != null","rationale":"The parameter m must be non-null because the method immediately calls instance methods on m.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.887635698Z"}
{"id":"dc2c58ac-b555-4fd0-a311-c7710c77dd47","expr":"m.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The method uses m.getParameterTypes().length in the for loop, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.887635698Z"}
{"id":"ded7f43a-57b8-439e-91d8-b920f90388ae","expr":"m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The return type of the method must be non-null since getDesc is called on it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.887635698Z"}
{"id":"a367be63-fd14-43f0-84cf-60a664208027","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the parameter types array must be non-negative since arrays cannot have negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.887635698Z"}
{"id":"20c26e72-4afe-4d1d-87d2-86143faade12","expr":"!m.getParameterTypes().equals(null)","rationale":"Redundant with m.getParameterTypes() != null but expressed differently for clarity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.887635698Z"}
{"id":"bb79b8b2-d3b4-43fd-bda6-6b0b6c03b9dd","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The method begins building the descriptor string with '(' so result should start with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.899477042Z"}
{"id":"bc6d35b9-4013-4da5-aba9-323167c044e3","expr":"result.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The closing parenthesis ')' is always appended after parameter types, so result contains ')'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.899477042Z"}
{"id":"72ae4fe1-0922-458d-8f28-86e1bbe4fb64","expr":"result.indexOf('(') < result.indexOf(')')","rationale":"The descriptor format ensures '(' comes before ')'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.899477042Z"}
{"id":"8377bc89-8998-4e54-93cb-25c34cfba1fb","expr":"result.length() >= 2","rationale":"The returned descriptor includes at least '()' and the return type descriptor, so length is at least 2.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(CtMethod):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.899477042Z"}
{"id":"7f6614b7-3c24-4f2a-be82-34a670d3a0c8","expr":"desc != null && desc.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"ReflectUtils#desc2name is called with JVM type descriptors which often start with '[' for arrays.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2name(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.901733288Z"}
{"id":"de6151a5-7e6a-4803-bf11-f7259adb40f8","expr":"desc.lastIndexOf('[') + 1 <= desc.length()","rationale":"Ensures c is a valid index within desc string to avoid out of bounds errors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2name(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.901733288Z"}
{"id":"2a3a88a0-030e-421f-bb86-1862b9caee83","expr":"desc.length() >= 1","rationale":"The desc string must at least contain one character representing a type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2name(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:49.901733288Z"}
