{"id":"1779aa8c-d0a1-4b6a-85b5-9d8cb49b1ff4","expr":"result == null || cls != null && (result.getDeclaringClass() == cls || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(cls))","rationale":"If result is non-null, its declaring class is cls or a superclass of cls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoUtils#getField(Class<?>,String):Field","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/PojoUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:51.152494710Z"}
