{"id":"40bf2aeb-c55b-4ba4-a87a-16a47216c926","expr":"allowedList != null && !allowedList.isEmpty()","rationale":"allowedList being non-null and usually non-empty is relevant to the method's purpose.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadPrefix(Set<String>):long[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:51.196090263Z"}
{"id":"28f990be-4120-45b7-9a44-1d405c994942","expr":"!allowedList.contains(\"\")","rationale":"Empty string is filtered out in the method, so typically not in the allowedList.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadPrefix(Set<String>):long[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:51.196090263Z"}
