{"id":"3527937e-d0cd-496b-b026-ff0892b733dc","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative; reflects the parameter count of the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.AdaptiveClassCodeGenerator#generateMethodArguments(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/AdaptiveClassCodeGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:52.724343556Z"}
