{"id":"7a3e662a-355d-48fa-b16c-fa063ccd7754","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Index is expected to be non-negative for generating valid code.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.AdaptiveClassCodeGenerator#generateUrlNullCheck(int):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/AdaptiveClassCodeGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:26:52.734428655Z"}
